            {
                "text": "\"He wrote that all the time,\" Lise Fenner says. \"It means somebody ordered it. A farm wants salt, a chapel wants nails, he takes them, he writes *as asked*.\" She looks at the line for a long time, though she cannot read it. \"Or it means he'd been told not to write the name. I don't know. I never asked him what he carried. You don't, if you want him to keep coming home.\"",
                "interjections": [
