        "every_one": [
            {
                "text": "It takes most of an hour, with Lise Fenner scrubbing the pot beside you and not asking. *As asked* comes up forty times in twenty years. Thirty-nine of them have a name in the margin, in the same hand, a little smaller: *Hobb. The chapel. Mrs Tey. Marrow.*\n\nThe hill store has no name in the margin.\n\nThat is either the most important line in the book or a carter who was tired that day. There is nobody left alive who can tell you which, and the book does not care.",
                "on_enter": [
                    {
                        "set_flag": "fenmoor_no_name"
                    }
                ],
                "interjections": [
                    {
                        "companion": "aldric",
                        "text": "Aldric: \"One in forty. A man forgets one in forty. I forget more than that.\" He does not sound as if he believes it either."
                    }
                ],
